issues.description:
When attempting to save a PCF cabinet to an exercise option action for a base contract, the following error message is received "Object Reference not set to an instance of an Object"

When looking at the drop down options in the open action menu, I noticed that the Mod Base Ex-Opt is not showing, this might be what's causing it to not be able to save but I'm not totally sure

![image](/uploads/0c4612268a73d13d03a018cee695a61c/image.png){width=900 height=383}

Add version number to app header. This will make it easier for users to know when the app has been updated. 

An example implementation: 
